      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SEED STUDY — the model is a distribution, not a printer.\n\nAll four generators share one prompt; only the SEED differs. Every seed is a different valid answer to the same request. There is no single 'correct' image hiding behind your prompt — there is a whole space of them, and the seed picks where you land.\n\nHOW TO WORK\n1. Run once, compare the four results side by side.\n2. Find the one closest to your intent and copy its seed forward into other workflows ('fixed' keeps it from changing).\n3. Now tighten the PROMPT and re-run: good prompt edits shift ALL four in the same direction; the seed keeps each column comparable before/after.\n\nEXERCISE: pick the strongest of the four and write down WHY it's stronger (composition? light? proportion?). That vocabulary is your art direction."
      ],
